 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Nice of you to bring everyone together. For a reunion this size, a venue with a full kitchen is the way to go. That way, everyone stays on one floor and gets to know each other over a shared dinner. Lovely. Set aside few rooms for socializing before dinner, and think about a team building activity too. A tour of a local historic site counts. Good plan. Just check that everyone else brings enough for one plate each, so there's no shortfall. People usually sleep where they arrive from, so there' no need to plan that. Just make sure there's enough chairs and bathrooms at whatever venue you choose.",
